@page
@model GovOwn
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Governemnt Programs";
}

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="divider">Government Programs</div>
        <h3>Bridging National Support to Our Local Community</h3>
        <p style="max-width:640px;">At Rural Bank of Norala, we actively collaborate with national government agencies, credit guarantee corporations, and regulatory bodies to bring low-cost financing, crop protection, and socialized financial services directly to countryside communities.</p>
        <p style="max-width:640px;">By participating in key government-backed credit and insurance initiatives, we help ensure that local farmers, micro-entrepreneurs, and families have access to the capital and security they need to thrive.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="divider">Key Government Partnerships</div>
        <h3>Three Pillars of Support</h3>

        <div class="grid grid-3" style="margin-top:30px;">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Agricultural Credit &amp; Capital Access</h3>
                <p style="font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--color-soil);">DA, ACPC, &amp; SB Corporation</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Crop &amp; Asset Protection</h3>
                <p style="font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--color-soil);">PCIC &amp; PhilGuarantee</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Deposit Security &amp; Regulatory Compliance</h3>
                <p style="font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--color-soil);">BSP &amp; PDIC</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="divider">Programs We Participate In</div>
        <h3>Our Institutional Partnerships</h3>

        <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top:30px;">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>1. Agricultural Credit Policy Council (ACPC)</h3>
                <p><strong>What It Offers:</strong> Special credit programs designed to extend affordable, low-interest capital to smallholder farmers and fisherfolk.</p>
                <p><strong>How It Helps You:</strong> Enables us to offer subsidized agricultural loans with flexible repayment structures aligned with local harvesting cycles.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>2. Philippine Crop Insurance Corporation (PCIC)</h3>
                <p><strong>What It Offers:</strong> Insurance coverage for agricultural crops (rice, corn, high-value crops), livestock, and farm machinery against natural disasters, plant diseases, and pest infestations.</p>
                <p><strong>How It Helps You:</strong> We assist our agri-loan borrowers in enrolling their crops and assets under PCIC protection, safeguarding their livelihoods when unforeseen climate events strike.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>3. Philippine Guarantee Corporation (PhilGuarantee)</h3>
                <p><strong>What It Offers:</strong> Credit guarantee coverage for agricultural, housing, and micro, small, and medium enterprise (MSME) loans.</p>
                <p><strong>How It Helps You:</strong> Reduces credit risk and collateral demands, allowing small farmers and local business owners to secure loans even with limited assets.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>4. Small Business Corporation (SB Corporation / DTI)</h3>
                <p><strong>What It Offers:</strong> Microfinance and small enterprise credit support under the Department of Trade and Industry (DTI).</p>
                <p><strong>How It Helps You:</strong> Provides capital support for local sari-sari stores, traders, and small agri-processors looking to expand their inventory or equipment.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="divider">Regulatory Bodies &amp; Depositor Protections</div>
        <h3>Your Deposits Are Safe, Transparent, and Regulated</h3>
        <p style="max-width:640px;">Our participation in national financial frameworks guarantees that your deposits and financial transactions remain safe, transparent, and regulated:</p>

        <table class="data-table" style="margin-top:30px;">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Agency</th>
                    <th>Role</th>
                    <th>What It Means for Depositors</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Bangko Sentral ng Pilipinas (BSP)</strong></td>
                    <td>Central Bank &amp; Banking Regulator</td>
                    <td>Ensures Rural Bank of Norala operates under strict liquidity, capital adequacy, and consumer protection standards.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Philippine Deposit Insurance Corporation (PDIC)</strong></td>
                    <td>Government Deposit Insurance Fund</td>
                    <td>Protects and insures valid bank deposits up to ₱500,000 per depositor.</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="divider">Getting Started</div>
        <h3>How to Access Government-Backed Programs</h3>
        <p style="max-width:640px;">Accessing government credit or insurance support through Rural Bank of Norala is straightforward:</p>

        <div class="grid grid-3" style="margin-top:30px;">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>1. Visit Our Office</h3>
                <p>Speak with our Account Officers to determine which program fits your farm, business, or household needs.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>2. Submit Documentation</h3>
                <p>Prepare your basic IDs, farm or business records, and proof of residence (such as a Barangay Clearance or RSBSA enrollment).</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>3. Streamlined Processing</h3>
                <p>We handle the coordination with government partner agencies to process your loan, guarantee, or crop insurance enrollment seamlessly.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>